    "detailed_description": "\u25a0The plot<br />\r\nA Nipopo doll sheds a tear\u2014another soul is sheds its mortal coil.<br />\r\nOne morning, a man's body is found floating in the Tokyo bay.<br />\r\nHe's estimated to be in his forties.<br />\r\nBut the incident doesn't stop here. It moves to Hokkaido's cities: Kushiro, Abashiri, Shiretoko, Monbetsu...<br />\r\nA second and third murder link the northern island to Tokyo.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0The gameplay<br />\r\nThe Okhotsk Disappearance is a graphic adventure game where you play as a police detective.<br />\r\nYour job is to find the truth behind the serial murders with the help of your subordinates.<br />\r\nTo do so, you have a command interface with 14 actions, such as &quot;Change Location&quot; and &quot;Ask someone&quot;.",
    "about_the_game": "\u25a0The plot<br />\r\nA Nipopo doll sheds a tear\u2014another soul is sheds its mortal coil.<br />\r\nOne morning, a man's body is found floating in the Tokyo bay.<br />\r\nHe's estimated to be in his forties.<br />\r\nBut the incident doesn't stop here. It moves to Hokkaido's cities: Kushiro, Abashiri, Shiretoko, Monbetsu...<br />\r\nA second and third murder link the northern island to Tokyo.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0The gameplay<br />\r\nThe Okhotsk Disappearance is a graphic adventure game where you play as a police detective.<br />\r\nYour job is to find the truth behind the serial murders with the help of your subordinates.<br />\r\nTo do so, you have a command interface with 14 actions, such as &quot;Change Location&quot; and &quot;Ask someone&quot;.",
    "short_description": "The legendary Okhotsk Disappearance... is coming back.",
